message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: dataset
title: "Online Appendix: Benchmarking and Fine-Tuning Open-Weight ASR Foundation Models for Real-World German Telephone Speech"
abstract: >-
  Supplementary material for the ICASSP 2027 submission "Benchmarking
  and Fine-Tuning Open-Weight ASR Foundation Models for Real-World
  German Telephone Speech": full per-fold breakdowns, the complete
  28-configuration LoRA search, the full degradation matrix,
  normalization methodology, and inference settings that did not fit
  the paper's page limit.
